        title: "Background",
        html: "<p>Dr. Angela De La O was born and raised in Salt Lake City. She earned her bachelor&#8217;s degree at the University of Portland and returned to attend the University of Utah School of Medicine. She completed her pediatrics residency at Primary Children’s Hospital, then served an additional year as Chief Resident. We happily welcomed Dr. De La O to Wasatch Pediatrics in 2010 at our Salt Lake office.</p>\n<p>Dr. De La O is a dedicated and caring physician. She has a bubbly personality that her patients and staff alike adore. She enjoys working with families and providing care for the whole family – from the time a child is an infant through adolescence.</p>\n<p>When not practicing medicine, Dr. De La O enjoys exploring the outdoors with her two sons. She also loves telling jokes to bring joy to those around her.</p>",
