        title: "Background",
        html: "<p>Dr. Jake Jones is a Utah native and joined our Cottonwood practice in 2016. He graduated as valedictorian at Utah State University and was subsequently awarded the highest academic scholarship offered to attend medical school at the University of Utah. He also completed his pediatric residency through the University of Utah at Primary Children’s Hospital.</p>\n<p>As a pediatrician, Dr. Jones is known for his caring demeanor, readiness to listen, and generous investment towards patients. In his spare time, he enjoys outdoor activities, and spending time with his family.</p>\n<p>Dr. Jones is currently accepting new patients and is available for a friendly ‘Meet &amp; Greet.’</p>",
