        html: "<p>Steven Ostergaard graduated from Brigham Young University as a Family Nurse Practitioner.  Prior to joining our Southpoint office in 2006, he worked in an infant high-risk clinic for the State Health Department.  He also worked at Primary Children&#8217;s Hospital doing Life Flight for a number of years and spent 23 years working in the emergency department.  Steven also served in the 19th Special Forces Group as a medic.</p>\n<p>Steven enjoys home remodeling, fishing, riding ATV&#8217;s with his family, and camping.  He is also now trying his hand at golfing.</p>",
