        title: "Background",
        html: "<p>Dr. Jonathan Tew is a native of Bountiful and graduated from Brigham Young University.  He earned his medical degree from Ross University then completed his pediatric residency at Southern Illinois University School of Medicine in Springfield, Illinois. He has been practicing at our Grow Up Great location since 2012.</p>\n<p>Dr. Tew loves being a pediatrician and feels fortunate to serve families in Davis County.  He enjoys all aspects of pediatric care including newborn and well child care, nutrition, infectious disease, asthma, ADHD, and adolescent medicine.</p>\n<p>Dr. Tew and his wife are the proud parents of seven children, including twin daughters. He enjoys all that parenthood entails including participating in recitals, plays, sporting events, camping, and skiing.  As his children grow, he also appreciates the changing role and opportunities associated with parenting adult children.</p>",
